.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-fC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TET</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.158em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-caC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.147em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TDG/BER</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 5-hmC（5-羟甲基胞嘧啶）在大脑中含量最高，与神经可塑性和认知衰老密切相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第一代时钟-horvath与hannum\">第一代时钟：Horvath与Hannum</h2><p><strong>Horvath 多组织时钟（2013）</strong> 是首个跨组织通用的表观遗传年龄预测器。Steve Horvath 利用超过8000份来自51种组织/细胞类型的 Illumina 450K 甲基化芯片数据，通过弹性网（Elastic Net）回归筛选出353个CpG位点。</p>\n<p>模型数学表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DNAm Age</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>353</mn></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DNAm Age} = F^{-1}\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^{353} w_i \\cdot \\beta_i + w_0\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DNAm Age</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0788em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">353</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个CpG位点的甲基化β值（0-1），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为回归权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为对数线性变换函数（在21岁前后切换行为以适应发育期快速变化）。</p>\n<p><strong>Hannum 血液时钟（2013）</strong> 专注于血液样本，使用71个CpG位点，在血液年龄预测方面比 Horvath 时钟更精确（MAE约3.9年 vs 4.9年），但缺乏跨组织通用性。</p>\n<p>两者的关键差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Horvath</th>\n<th>Hannum</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>训练样本</td>\n<td>多组织混合</td>\n<td>仅外周血</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CpG数量</td>\n<td>353</td>\n<td>71</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨组织适用性</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>仅血液</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MAE(误差)</td>\n<td>≈4.9年</td>\n<td>≈3.9年(血液)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发育期建模</td>\n<td>有(对数线性变换)</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"第二代时钟-从年龄预测到健康预测\">第二代时钟：从年龄预测到健康预测</h2><p>第一代时钟虽能准确预测时序年龄，但「年龄加速」（Age Acceleration = DNAm Age - Chronological Age）与死亡率的关联并不总是稳健。第二代时钟转向以健康结局为训练目标。</p>\n<p><strong>PhenoAge（2018, Levine等）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>训练策略：先用10项临床指标（白蛋白、肌酐、血糖、CRP、淋巴细胞比例等）训练出表型年龄；再用DNA甲基化预测该表型年龄</li>\n<li>513个CpG位点；MAE约2.5年</li>\n<li>表型年龄加速（PhenoAgeAccel）与全因死亡率、心血管疾病、癌症发病强相关</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>GrimAge（2019, Lu等）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>训练策略：用DNA甲基化预测多个血浆蛋白水平（包括PAI-1、GDF-15等）和吸烟包年数，再组合预测死亡时间</li>\n<li>1030个CpG位点；死亡率预测能力最强</li>\n<li>GrimAge加速每增加1个标准差，全因死亡HR≈1.56</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"第三代时钟-dunedinpace与衰老速度\">第三代时钟：DunedinPACE与衰老速度</h2><p>DunedinPACE（Pace of Aging Computed from the Epigenome, 2022）代表了概念跨越——它不再测量「你有多老」（状态），而是测量「你衰老得有多快」（速率）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Dunedin研究队列] --&gt; B[1037人 · 出生至45岁纵向随访]&#10;    B --&gt; C[20年间重复测量19项器官功能指标]&#10;    C --&gt; D[计算个体衰老速度 Pace of Aging]&#10;    D --&gt; E[用DNA甲基化预测该速度]&#10;    E --&gt; F[DunedinPACE 173 CpG]&#10;    F --&gt; G[输出: 衰老速度比值]&#10;    G --&gt; H[1.0 = 平均速度]&#10;    G --&gt; I[&gt;1.0 = 加速衰老]&#10;    G --&gt; J[&lt;1.0 = 减速衰老]\">graph LR\n    A[Dunedin研究队列] --&gt; B[1037人 · 出生至45岁纵向随访]\n    B --&gt; C[20年间重复测量19项器官功能指标]\n    C --&gt; D[计算个体衰老速度 Pace of Aging]\n    D --&gt; E[用DNA甲基化预测该速度]\n    E --&gt; F[DunedinPACE 173 CpG]\n    F --&gt; G[输出: 衰老速度比值]\n    G --&gt; H[1.0 = 平均速度]\n    G --&gt; I[&gt;1.0 = 加速衰老]\n    G --&gt; J[&lt;1.0 = 减速衰老]</pre><p>DunedinPACE的核心优势：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>传统时钟</th>\n<th>DunedinPACE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>测量物</td>\n<td>生物年龄(状态)</td>\n<td>衰老速度(变化率)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干预敏感性</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>高(可检测短期干预效果)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>所需CpG数</td>\n<td>71-1030</td>\n<td>173</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合追踪干预效果</td>\n<td>需长期观察</td>\n<td>短期内可见变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与功能衰退关联</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DunedinPACE 的干预敏感性使其成为评估抗衰老策略效果的理想工具。2026年的研究表明，PEARL试验中雷帕霉素组的DunedinPACE呈现剂量依赖性降低趋势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"表观遗传时钟的临床转化挑战\">表观遗传时钟的临床转化挑战</h2><p>尽管研究级表观遗传时钟表现优异，临床普及仍面临多重障碍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战维度</th>\n<th>具体问题</th>\n<th>当前进展</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成本与可及性</td>\n<td>Illumina EPIC芯片约200-500美元/样本</td>\n<td>基于ELOVL2等少数位点的简化时钟开发中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准化</td>\n<td>不同实验室间批次效应显著</td>\n<td>参考标准品和数据处理流水线标准化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人群特异性</td>\n<td>大多数时钟在白人群体训练</td>\n<td>多族群验证研究正在进行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果性不明</td>\n<td>甲基化变化是衰老原因还是结果？</td>\n<td>因果推断方法(MR分析)探索中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费者市场可信度</td>\n<td>DTC检测质控参差</td>\n<td>行业自律标准建立中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026年5月《Biogerontology》综述指出，下一代表观遗传时钟应优先考虑分析简便性（减少CpG位点数）和多样化人群验证，以支持从研究工具向临床常规的转化。基于 ELOVL2 单基因的简约时钟（仅需7个CpG位点）展现了「极简但稳健」的方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>表观遗传时钟是长寿医学最重要的测量工具之一——它将「衰老」从模糊的定性概念转化为可量化、可追踪的数值。从第一代的年龄预测器，到第二代的死亡率预测器，再到第三代的衰老速度计，技术演进正朝着更高的干预敏感性和临床可及性方向发展。理解这些工具的原理和局限，是后续「生物标志物与监测」章节的基础，也是评估任何抗衰老干预效果的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"表观遗传时钟：DNA甲基化与生物年龄测量","id":"表观遗传时钟-dna甲基化与生物年龄测量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"DNA甲基化的年龄依赖性变化","id":"dna甲基化的年龄依赖性变化"},{"level":2,"text":"第一代时钟：Horvath与Hannum","id":"第一代时钟-horvath与hannum"},{"level":2,"text":"第二代时钟：从年龄预测到健康预测","id":"第二代时钟-从年龄预测到健康预测"},{"level":2,"text":"第三代时钟：DunedinPACE与衰老速度","id":"第三代时钟-dunedinpace与衰老速度"},{"level":2,"text":"表观遗传时钟的临床转化挑战","id":"表观遗传时钟的临床转化挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"细胞衰老机制：端粒、线粒体与衰老信号通路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/aging-biology/cellular-senescence-mechanisms"},"next":{"title":"衰老标志物：十二大Hallmarks全景解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/aging-biology/hallmarks-of-aging"}}